<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (We also constantly & relentlessly strive in the evolution of electricity markets with flagship initiatives like introduction of Real Time Market \(RTM\) and Ancillary Services to facilitate integration of Renewable Energy and economy in operations and valuing various resources, including the Human Resources. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
