163 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (GRID-INDIA aspires to be a catalyst for a successful energy transition and consequently to achieve a reliable, sustainable and affordable energy eco-system. By persistent policy advocacy and participation in the regulatory reform process, GRID-INDIA promotes both the grid integration of renewables and further expansion of the Indian energy market appropriately designed to accommodate distributed generation and new technologies such as Electric Vehicles and Storage.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [6]
>>
